        <mxCell id="b_trans" value="&lt;b&gt;FLAGGED TRANSITIVE DEPENDENCIES FOR 3NF RESOLUTION:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• In DRIVERS_2NF: user_id determines full_name and user credentials.&lt;br&gt;• In RIDES_2NF: driver_id determines driver franchise status.&lt;br&gt;• Resolving into 3NF ensures every non-key attribute depends ONLY on the Primary Key." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
